Closes: https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/drm/intel/-/issues/1811
Fixes: 8e99299a04bc ("drm/i915/gt: Track use of RPS interrupts in flags")
Signed-off-by: Chris Wilson <chris@chris-wilson.co.uk>
